    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12194" root="دحض" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَحْضٌ</span></b>  A <i>slippery</i> place; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَحَضٌ</span></b>  (S,
K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَحُوضٌ</span></b>  (O, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِدْحَضٌ</span></b>  (Freytag,
from the Deewán of the Hudhalees,) [or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَدْحَضٌ</span>?]: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِحَاضٌ</span>, (K,) [a pl. of the second,]
like as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِبَالٌ</span> is pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَبَلٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>Water
that causes slipping:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَدْحَاضٌ</span>. (TA.)

